<section id="days">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head">
      <div>
        <p class="kicker">How the five days run</p>
        <h2>Interviews, your own data, and a readout in person.</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="sub">We keep the ask on your team small. Most of the work happens on our side.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step"><div class="n">DAY 1</div><h3>MAP</h3><p>Interviews with management and department leads, and a walk through the store. We learn how work actually moves, not how the org chart says it does.</p></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="n">DAY 2</div><h3>MEASURE</h3><p>We work from exports of your CRM and DMS data, with customer-identifying details removed before analysis, to see how long each handoff really takes.</p></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="n">DAY 3</div><h3>FIND</h3><p>Where the handoffs break, what each break costs, and which tools you already pay for could fix it.</p></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="n">DAY 4</div><h3>PRIORITIZE</h3><p>Every opportunity ranked on impact, effort, risk and whether your people will actually use it.</p></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="n">DAY 5</div><h3>READOUT</h3><p>We walk leadership through the findings in person and recommend a first project. You keep the full report.</p></div>
      <div class="step last"><div class="n">AFTER</div><h3>YOUR CALL</h3><p>Implementation is scoped from what we found. There's no obligation to continue.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

